aufs-ng (0~git20261111.34e6c99-1minios1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Update to upstream commit 34e6c99 (2026-11-11).
  * Adopt upstream inotify-pinned directory and dead directory fixes.
  * Retain Linux 6.12 DKMS compatibility and modern 7.3/7.4 API support.
  * Preserve support for revalidating local block-backed filesystems.
  * Refresh quilt series and retain ext4/ext2/Btrfs VM regressions.
  * Update source licensing metadata for GPL-2.0-or-later.

