aufs-ng (0~git20260807.842ab15-1minios4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Support revalidation callbacks on local block-backed filesystem branches.
  * Keep remote filesystems and custom name operations unsupported.
  * Extend VM regression coverage to ext2 and optional Btrfs roots.

